                                                "sense_id": "e500fd95-2036-37bb-baa3-677786bfd68e",
                                                "text": "It dates from 1909-1911, when the then District Railway (its DR monogram is on one of the roundels in the fine plasterwork) rebuilt its Victoria station."
                                            }
